      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I accidentally found out today that it was removed because it was buggy.\n\nFrom the open beta VRChat 2021.4.1, build 1140 note  https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/503009489486872583/898728604299563068 :\n\n```\n\n- The Panorama button in the Quick Menu has been removed due to several issues. There are many compounding bugs with this feature, and trying to fix it right now will slow down this release. We'll circle back around and implement it properly at a later time.\n\n  - VRChive Panorama has also been removed for similar reasons\n\n```\n\nMergeable post: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/bring-back-panorama-pictures",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
